 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id2000637\" class=\"interactive\" data-label=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<h3 data-type=\"title\" class=\"os-subtitle\">\n  <span class=\"os-subtitle-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h3>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id2023248\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/9aa20cb70cb03ad55460a1ee49fc55bb35e28332\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></span>\n<p id=\"fs-id2292278\">See receptor-mediated endocytosis in action, and click on different <a href=\"https://openstaxcollege.org/l/endocytosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">parts</a> for a focused animation.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
